+
+Use the attached reviewer's A1–D5 identifiers. The 18 mandatory rows below are the initial inventory, not an assertion of 18 passing tests. Every behavior test loads bytes obtained from `curator shell-init <shell>` or the real `shell-init --install` cache path. Run bash with `--noprofile --norc`, zsh with `-f`, and native PowerShell with `-NoProfile -NonInteractive`; drive actual prompt callbacks and zsh directory-change callbacks. Use bounded processes, scratch HOME/config and literal synthetic fixtures. No fixture may need a real credential.
