+|---|---|
+| **A1–A2** | Hostile project env file at root and nested entry: no stdout marker/file side effect, but correct root/PATH activation. Repeat with matching old operator/manager records, forged local records, missing env file and unreadable env file. New hook behavior must be independent of all records. |
+| **A3** | `.agents`, env file and project-root symlinks separately and combined; retain activation without executing payloads. Include broken links, cycles, alias reentry and physical-root expectations. |
+| **A4** | Hostile global env files never execute, with/without legacy approvals and when project scanning is off. Global root/bin still activate unless `--no-global` is selected. |
